<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tribune EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tribune EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co said Monday it raised its earnings per share estimates on Tribune Co to $2.21 from $2.10 for 1997 and to $2.55 from $2.50 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Rita Zanella said the media and entertainment company reported higher than anticipated first quarter results.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We continue to recommend purchase with a (12-month) price target of $52, representing a potential upside of 24 percent,&quot; Zanella said in a report.</p>
<p>-- Tribune was up 7/8 at 42-3/4.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
